    { math: '2 · From sect to empire', note: 'Paul\'s missions took the movement to Gentiles (deciding non-Jews needn\'t keep Torah — the Council of Jerusalem, ~50 CE). Constantine legalised it (313); Theodosius made it the state religion (380). The persecuted became the establishment.' },
